					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210205
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210205,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}看現在，燉湯的人也不在，這個湯這麼香，我們不如偷偷喝一口嚐一嚐吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210206,
						730210208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210206,
					"content": "那我們就偷偷喝一口吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210207,
					"content": "好耶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210212,
					"content": "鍋容量比看起來的要小。\\n裡面的內容物就這樣全部不見了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210213,
					"content": "噗哈…嗯？這個湯，香倒是很香，但是怎麼感覺嚐不出什麼味道呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210214,
					"content": "#蘭穆護昆達在上！{F#妳}{M#你}們這些那菈，怎麼回事！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210215,
					"content": "蘭、蘭那羅？到底是從哪裡突然出現的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210216,
					"content": "#從地裡啦！不說這個，{F#妳}{M#你}們怎麼能偷喝我做的湯，那可是我蘭阿帕斯辛辛苦苦做出來的湯耶！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210217,
						730210220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210217,
					"content": "對不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210218,
					"content": "對不起…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210219,
					"content": "哼，偷喝了我的湯，一句對不起就夠了嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210223,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們知道在這裡做湯有多難嗎？一下子，天上下雨。一下子，太陽出來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210224,
					"content": "嗯？說來最近「法留納神機」穩定了很多，天氣也正常了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210225,
					"content": "其實就是我們啦…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210226,
					"content": "#哼，修好「法留納神機」的一定是那個那菈那樣的好那菈，才不是{F#妳}{M#你}們這樣的「湯小偷」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210227,
					"content": "小偷什麼的，別說得這麼難聽嘛！我們只是因為味道太香才…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210228,
					"content": "不過，既然這麼困難，為什麼要在這裡做湯呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210229,
					"content": "哼，烹飪最關鍵的東西，必須每天都要取得的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210230,
						730210231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210230,
					"content": "是身為廚師的自尊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210232,
					"content": "是水！是水啦！湯的香味，受水影響很大，當然要用最好的水來做湯啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210233,
					"content": "我一路上，在水天叢林取各個地方的水來做湯。採集了好多好多、有樹上的葉子那麼多的水樣以後，才找到了最好的「活源水」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210234,
					"content": "#那才是配得上無憂節的「至上珍饈」！就算跟{F#妳}{M#你}們說這個，{F#妳}{M#你}們一定也不明白吧…只有之前那個那菈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210235,
					"content": "說到這個，其實我們是從蘭帕卡提那來的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210236,
					"content": "向蘭阿帕斯述說事情的經過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210237
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210237,
					"content": "啊，原來是「妹妹」的那菈朋友！而且，要舉辦無憂節了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210238,
					"content": "不過沒有關係，我已經取得「活源水」，我的「至上珍饈」已經完成。就在這個鍋裡…然後…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210239,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210240,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210241,
					"content": "欸嘿嘿。你別難過，湯聞起來真的很香…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210242,
					"content": "啊，我的「活源水」！水的源頭住著「亞普修那」，好不容易等到它們離開水源，我才取了一鍋…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210243,
					"content": "#不行，{F#妳}{M#你}們一定要再取一鍋「活源水」賠給我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210244,
					"content": "「亞普修那」…？那是什麼東西？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210245,
					"content": "哼，那菈對森林真是一點也不瞭解。就是那種住在水裡的，四條腿、有尾巴、會咬咬的東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210246,
					"content": "…狗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210247,
						730210248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210247,
					"content": "狗不住在水裡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210249
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210249,
					"content": "啊，也對。那「亞普修那」到底是什麼呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210250,
					"content": "別管「亞普修那」了！我要水！而且要那邊的「活源水」！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210251,
					"content": "#好啦好啦…{NICKNAME}，沒辦法，我們走吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210252,
						730210253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210252,
					"content": "哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210254
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210254,
					"content": "一定要「活源水」，其他的水都不行！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210253,
					"content": "走吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210254
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210248,
					"content": "哪來的水狗。純水之狗嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210249
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210231,
					"content": "是不忘初心的意志？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210220,
					"content": "都、都是派蒙…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210221
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210221,
					"content": "#喂！{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}居然出賣我！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210222,
					"content": "我才不管是誰喝的啦，反正我的湯沒有了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210208,
					"content": "這不太好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210209,
					"content": "我是真的很好奇嘛，嗚，我就偷偷喝一口，就一口！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210210,
					"content": "要是喝壞肚子就不好了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210211
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210211,
					"content": "哼哼，可不要小看派蒙！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302103,
			"completionStepIds": [],
