			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730210301,
					"content": "我的湯…嗚嗚…怎麼會這樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210302,
					"content": "（默默離開吧…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7302104,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7302103
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_AND",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7302103",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7302103,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"蘭阿帕斯",
					"派蒙"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 730210401,
					"content": "…嗯，確實是河流源頭的水，「活源水」凜冽又乾淨，和月光一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210402,
					"content": "如果蘭茶荼、蘭薩卡和蘭非拉是吸著這樣的水長大的，那肯定不會變成現在這樣的笨蛋。只有蘭帕卡提，我的妹妹…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210403,
					"content": "咳咳，接下來…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210404,
					"content": "#嗯？對了，接下來，{F#妳}{M#你}們要做一鍋湯賠給我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210405,
					"content": "在蘭阿帕斯的指導下，在水中加入了一些蔬果，開始烹飪。\\n鍋中慢慢傳出了不錯的香味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210406
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210406,
					"content": "完成後，一同品嚐了剛剛做好的「湯」。\\n…應該說是符合預期吧，雖然確實有食材的香味…\\n但沒有任何調味的湯果然還是太純粹了。\\n一點味道也沒有。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210407
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210407,
					"content": "嗯嗯，「至上珍饈」當然就是要有這樣的香味才對！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210408,
					"content": "#嗯…{F#妳}{M#你}覺得呢，{NICKNAME}？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210409,
						730210410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210409,
					"content": "以湯的角度來說，確實能解渴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210411
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210411,
					"content": "我覺得，如果加點鹽和胡椒，應該會比較美味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210412,
					"content": "任何東西加鹽和胡椒都會變得美味。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210413
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210413,
					"content": "蘭穆護昆達在上！竟然要加鹽…鹽是多麼可怕的東西！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210414,
					"content": "有鹽的土地上，就沒有生命，蘭那羅只能退縮成乾種子…那菈竟然要放鹽！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210415,
					"content": "#湯沒有味道，是理所應當的！{F#妳}{M#你}們這些那菈，竟然不懂這樣的道理。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210416,
					"content": "以前那個那菈，喝了湯以後，就告訴過我們這樣的道理：",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210417,
					"content": "「我們那菈呀，到了孩子們要回家的時候，家裡都會傳來湯的香味。所以，湯只需要有香味。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210418,
					"content": "#然後，{MATEAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_HE|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_SHE]}誇我蘭阿帕斯的湯做得很好，很香。我一直記得。所以，我才不信{F#妳}{M#你}說的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210419,
					"content": "但只有香味也不行吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210420,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210421,
					"content": "#哼，不過既然{F#妳}{M#你}們是這次無憂節的那菈，那一定是蘭拉迦、蘭帕卡提他們認可的。沒辦法，就想辦法做有味道的湯吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210422,
					"content": "那下次就找更好的水來做湯，一定能做出更好的湯！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210423,
					"content": "…我倒覺得和水沒關係。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210424
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 730210424,
					"content": "是嘛…不過這次的「烹飪修行」已經圓滿結束了。好，一切都等到無憂節再說吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210425,
					"content": "#做湯的辦法也教給{F#妳}{M#你}們了。這可是偉大那菈認可的味道，{F#妳}{M#你}們多嚐嚐吧。但是，記住：一定要用好水！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "蘭阿帕斯"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210426,
					"content": "#（{NICKNAME}，下次我們加點調味料試試吧。味道應該會不錯…）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730210410,
					"content": "對我來說太健康了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730210411
					]
				}
			]
		},
